---
import BaseLayout from "../../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro";
import MetaPill from "../../../components/ui/MetaPill.astro";
import registry from "../../../data/phase-97-environment-climate-ecosystems-pollution-waste-circularity-planetary-system-stewardship-registry.json";
const climate = registry.greenhouse_gas_emissions_climate_mitigation_decarbonization_transition_dossiers;
const pollution = registry.air_water_soil_noise_chemical_pollution_exposure_environmental_justice_ledgers;
const ecosystems = registry.ecosystems_biodiversity_habitat_land_freshwater_ocean_restoration_registers;
const planetary = registry.waste_materials_circularity_climate_adaptation_disaster_risk_planetary_system_stewardship_ledgers;
---

<BaseLayout title="Environment, Climate, Ecosystems, Pollution, Waste, Circularity And Planetary-System Stewardship | FTFN" description="Thirty-two inactive climate, pollution, ecosystem, and planetary-stewardship records.">
  <section class="page-section hero" data-environment-climate-ecosystem-planetary-registry><div class="hero__copy"><div class="eyebrow">FTFN / Environmental Stewardship</div><h1 class="page-title">An emissions target is not delivered decarbonization, and protected-area designation is not ecosystem recovery.</h1><p class="lede">Phase 97 traces greenhouse-gas inventories, mitigation and just transition; pollution, exposure and environmental justice; ecosystems, biodiversity and durable restoration; then waste prevention, circularity, climate adaptation, disaster risk and planetary-system stewardship.</p><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label="8 inactive climate dossiers" tone="possibility" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive pollution ledgers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive ecosystem registers" /><MetaPill label="8 inactive planetary ledgers" /><MetaPill label="0 environmental decisions" tone="review" /></div></div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Emissions, Climate Mitigation And Just Transition</div><h2>Eight climate-mitigation dossiers remain closed.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/greenhouse-gas-inventories-carbon-budgets-targets-delivered-decarbonization-001/">Read the decarbonization guide</a></div><div class="grid">{climate.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.climate_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="20 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/environment-climate-ecosystems-pollution-waste-circularity/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Inventories, budgets, pathways, emissions, removals, policy delivery, just transition, review and receipts remain empty.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Pollution, Exposure, Environmental Health And Justice</div><h2>Eight exposure ledgers contain no healthy-environment decision.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/air-quality-noise-toxic-exposure-environmental-health-001/">Read the exposure guide</a></div><div class="grid">{pollution.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><div class="meta-row"><MetaPill label={record.pollution_state} tone="review" /><MetaPill label="22 inactive gates" /></div><h3><a href={'/evidence/environment-climate-ecosystems-pollution-waste-circularity/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.air_water_soil_noise_chemical_pollution_exposure_environmental_justice_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Sources, releases, hotspots, exposure, health, enforcement, remediation, compensation and environmental justice remain unassessed.</p></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Ecosystems, Biodiversity, Habitat And Restoration</div><h2>Eight ecosystem registers remain inactive.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/ecosystems-biodiversity-habitat-connectivity-species-recovery-001/">Read the ecological-integrity guide</a></div><div class="source-list">{ecosystems.map((record) => <article class="source-row"><div><h3><a href={'/evidence/environment-climate-ecosystems-pollution-waste-circularity/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.ecosystems_biodiversity_habitat_land_freshwater_ocean_restoration_register_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Condition, function, connectivity, species, disturbance, stewardship, monitoring, restoration and community value remain unassessed.</p></div><MetaPill label={record.ecosystem_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">Waste, Circularity, Adaptation And Planetary Stewardship</div><h2>Eight planetary ledgers contain no circularity or vulnerability decision.</h2></div><a class="inline-link" href="/briefings/planetary-boundaries-monitoring-restoration-long-horizon-001/">Read the planetary-stewardship guide</a></div><div class="grid">{planetary.map((record) => <article class="record-card"><h3><a href={'/evidence/environment-climate-ecosystems-pollution-waste-circularity/' + record.slug + '/'}>{record.waste_materials_circularity_climate_adaptation_disaster_risk_planetary_system_stewardship_ledger_id}: {record.named_entity}</a></h3><p>Prevention, repair, reuse, recycling, producer responsibility, vulnerability, adaptation, loss and damage, thresholds and recovery remain inactive.</p><MetaPill label={record.planetary_state} tone="review" /></article>)}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section briefing-band"><div class="briefing-band__copy"><div class="eyebrow">Public Contract</div><h2>Inspect the empty environmental-stewardship state.</h2><p>The export publishes the complete control surface without treating targets as decarbonization, permit limits as healthy exposure, designations as recovery, diversion as circularity, spending as reduced vulnerability, or repaired infrastructure as restored systems—and without scoring or deciding for an entity, community, ecosystem, place or jurisdiction.</p></div><article class="record-card"><a class="inline-link" href="/data/environment-climate-ecosystems-pollution-waste-circularity-planetary-system-stewardship.json">Environment, climate and planetary-stewardship JSON</a></article></section>
</BaseLayout>
